      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Skyline Drive, a scenic overlook of Cañon City, was originally constructed by inmates of the Territorial Prison.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ca%C3%B1on_City%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cañon City is famed for its fossil discoveries, Skyline Drive, and the historic Royal Gorge Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ca%C3%B1on_City%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1884, DeWeese discovered the largest dinosaur skeleton in the area—a Diplodocus longus—near Cañon City.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
