      "source": "https://www.canoncity.gov/629/History",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Cañon City’s Arkansas River attracts whitewater rafters and rock climbers seeking challenging drops and scenic routes.",
